        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "For three turns (including this one), moves used against the target have 100% accuracy, but the target is immune to Ground damage.  Accuracy of one-hit KO moves is exempt from this effect.\n\nThis effect is removed by Gravity.  If Gravity is already in effect, this move will fail.",
      "short_effect": "Moves have 100% accuracy against the target for three turns.",
